  "name": {
    "zh": "DeepSeek 大肥鱼 · 对局版",
    "en": "DeepSeek Chan · Game"
  },
  "about": {
    "zh": "**对局版**：同一只大肥鱼，画得小一号（约 0.68 倍），点击范围也跟着收窄 —— 炉石打牌时少挡手牌、少抢点击；跑起来一蹦一蹦。**她还会自己让开**：发现有窗口盖住屏幕底部中央（打牌、看视频）时，她就挪到牌区两侧，不挡手牌也不抢点击；桌面上没东西被她挡着就不躲。也可以直接叫她站到某侧（`pet_move_to` 的 `off-hand-left` / `off-hand-right`）。原版大肥鱼（Pal-AI-Lab 的 whale），外加一组**形象包自己实现的动作**：蹦迪、律动、打拍子、闭眼听、跟着哼、跟拍挥、余韵、凑近听、怔住、退半步、捂耳朵听。这些动作不靠改宿主实现 —— 宿主认不出它们时走 `act()` 的 default 分支，把 `{ kind, k }` 交给形象包自己画。一个 Q 版鲸鱼娘,二头身,侧身朝右站;蓝色长发、头顶一根呆毛,头两侧各一只鲸鱼鳍,身后一条鲸鱼尾巴;服装是括号里选的那套:女仆装是女仆裙和印着配色对应厂商标志",
    "en": "the same whale girl, drawn smaller (about 0.68x) with a matching narrower hit area, so she covers less of the hand while you play. a chibi whale girl, two heads tall, standing three-quarters on facing right; long blue hair with an ahoge, a whale fin on each side of the head, and a whale tail behind; she wears the outfit picked in brackets: the maid dress is a maid dress with an apron printed with the logo of the colour scheme's vendor, the winter outfit a cape with a whale hood and a striped scarf, and the crew uniform a fast-food crew uniform with a single ponytail, a red visor and headset, a striped shirt and a red skirt. she also steps clear on her own: when a window covers the bottom middle of the screen (a game, a video), she keeps out of that band, and stays put when nothing is behind her"
  },
  "author": "Mr.Q（衍生自 Pal-AI-Lab 的 whale）",
